<h3 id="Part-(b)-%5B4-pt%5D">Part (b) [4 pt]<a class="anchor-link" href="#Part-(b)-%5B4-pt%5D">¶</a></h3><p>Based on the test accuracy alone, it is difficult to assess whether our model
